  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:14e",
   "ptr": "0x14e",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "  はるか南方より来たる、\\n",
   "en": "Coming from the far south, the hammer of our forefathers, the Templar Knights, at last struck down the barbarians who held sway over this land, and made the holy light shine across all the earth...",
