   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:222",
   "ptr": "0x222",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  国土の８割が、荒れた山岳地帯である\\n",
   "en": "As 80% of our land is rugged mountains, it is only natural that our main products rely on mining. With domestic demand for our fine iron ore, precious metals and gems now at a plateau, we must seek a way forward in foreign trade, and to that end...",
