   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:896",
   "ptr": "0x896",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  クライツェンの成立した時代・・・\\n",
   "en": "The age when Kreutzen was founded... In that age of endless strife, weapons and armor of a power unthinkable today were made.",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:8bd",
   "ptr": "0x8bd",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  かつて、争いの絶えなかったあの時代\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00A:896"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:8e6",
   "ptr": "0x8e6",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  には、現在では考えられぬほど強力な\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00A:896"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:90f",
   "ptr": "0x90f",
   "len": 30,
