   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00A:896"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:931",
   "ptr": "0x931",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  それらの装備品には「覇者」もしくは\\n",
   "en": "Such gear bore the name \"Conqueror\" or \"Empress\", and lent its great power to chosen knights.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:95a",
   "ptr": "0x95a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  「女帝」の名が冠され、選ばれた騎士\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00A:931"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:983",
   "ptr": "0x983",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  たちに、その大いなる力を与えたので\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00A:931"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:9ac",
   "ptr": "0x9ac",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "  ある。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00A:931"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:9ba",
   "ptr": "0x9ba",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  しかし、それらの製造技術は失われ、\\n",
   "en": "But the art of making it was lost, and today its names survive only in written records...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:9e3",
   "ptr": "0x9e3",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  わずかに文献の中にのみ、その名を\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00A:9ba"
  },
