   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  に現存。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00A:c41"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:cad",
   "ptr": "0xcad",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "『遺跡調査報告』\\f",
   "en": "'Ruins Survey Report'",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:cc3",
   "ptr": "0xcc3",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  遺跡は地上と地下の二重構造になって\\n",
   "en": "The ruins have two levels, above ground and below. At the center of the surface is an altar leading below.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:cec",
   "ptr": "0xcec",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "  いる。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00A:cc3"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:cf9",
   "ptr": "0xcf9",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  地上部分の中央には、地下へ通じる\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  いる。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00A:cc3"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:d20",
   "ptr": "0xd20",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "  祭壇がある。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00A:cc3"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:d34",
   "ptr": "0xd34",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  これは、各遺跡共通の構造だ。\\f",
   "en": "All of the ruins share this structure.",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:d58",
   "ptr": "0xd58",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  地下には水が満たされ、光がまったく\\n",
   "en": "The underground level is flooded and utterly lightless, and torches and other flames cannot be used. A barrier that nullifies certain magic is also present, so magical light is impossible too.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:d81",
   "ptr": "0xd81",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  入ってこない上、たいまつなどの火も\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00A:d58"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:daa",
   "ptr": "0xdaa",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "  使えない。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00A:d58"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:dbc",
   "ptr": "0xdbc",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  また、ある種の魔法を無効化する結界\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00A:d58"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:de5",
   "ptr": "0xde5",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  が存在し、魔法による点灯も不可能で\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00A:d58"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:e0e",
   "ptr": "0xe0e",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "  ある。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00A:d58"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:e1c",
   "ptr": "0xe1c",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  ゆえに、地下部分の調査は、まったく\\n",
   "en": "Hence there is no prospect at all of progress in surveying the underground levels.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:e45",
   "ptr": "0xe45",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  進展の目処（メド）が立っていない。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00A:e1c"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:e6f",
   "ptr": "0xe6f",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "  そこには、黒竜の伝説に関する、\\n",
   "en": "Lore has it that something tied to the legend of the Black Dragon is hidden there...",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:e94",
   "ptr": "0xe94",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "  何かが隠されてるとの伝承もある\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00A:e6f"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:eb9",
   "ptr": "0xeb9",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "  のだが・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00A:e6f"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:ecd",
   "ptr": "0xecd",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  地下を満たす水は、いくら汲み出して\\n",
   "en": "However much of the water filling the underground is pumped out, it never goes down... This oddity may in fact be the key to the ruins' mystery.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:ef6",
   "ptr": "0xef6",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "  も、一向に減らない・・・\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00A:ecd"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:f15",
   "ptr": "0xf15",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  そのことが逆に、遺跡の謎を解くカギ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  も、一向に減らない・・・\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK00A:ecd"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK00A:f3e",
   "ptr": "0xf3e",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "  になりそうだ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
