   "ptr": "0xf6d",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  《黒竜》は、はるか昔、どこからとも\\n",
   "en": "The Black Dragon is a legendary dragon said to have come here from nowhere long ago and fallen asleep. It supposedly dwells deep in the Black Dragon Cave, but no one has seen it, and its existence is unproven.",
